# Root .dockerignore — applies to the ai-python image, whose build context is
# the repository root (see ai-python/Dockerfile). Keep ai-python/ + Aegis-AI/;
# drop everything else, plus heavy/mutable/secret paths inside the kept trees.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend
backend
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env
ai-python/scratch
ai-python/tests
# Mutable, PII-bearing runtime memory — mounted as volumes, never baked. NOTE:
# only the NESTED runtime dirs are excluded; the sibling *.json rule files
# (memory_rules, profile_schema, customer_segments, context rules, …) are
# static knowledge the engine loads and MUST stay in the image.
Aegis-AI/layer3/conversation_memory/conversations
Aegis-AI/layer3/conversation_memory/sessions
Aegis-AI/layer3/customer_profile/customer_profiles
Aegis-AI/layer3/customer_intelligence/intelligence_profiles
Aegis-AI/layer3/recommendation_context/cache
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
